names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Petersson</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Fugelstad</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Rajs</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Fatal intoxication as a consequence of intranasal administration (snorting) or pulmonary inhalation (smoking) of heroin</article-title><source>Forensic Science International</source><year>2004</year><volume>139</volume><fpage>241</fpage><lpage>247</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15040924</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.forsciint.2003.10.009</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kriegstein</surname><given-names>AR</given-names></name><name><surname>Armitage</surname><given-names>BA</given-names></name><name><surname>Kim</surname><given-names>PY</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Heroin Inhalation and Progressive Spongiform Leukoencephalopathy</article-title><source>New England Journal of Medicine</source><year>1997</year><volume>336</volume><fpage>589</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9036319</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1056/NEJM199702203360818</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hill</surname><given-names>MD</given-names></name><name><surname>Cooper</surname><given-names>PW</given-names></name><name><surname>Perry</surname><given-names>JR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Chasing the dragon &#x02014; neurological toxicity associated with inhalation of heroin vapour: case report</article-title><source>Canadian Medical Association Journal</source><year>2000</year><volume>162</volume><fpage>236</fpage><lpage>238</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10674060</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>St